    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Samples from the Yakima River Basin were analyzed for dissolved organic carbon (DOC, measured as non-purgeable organic carbon, NPOC), absorbance, and fluorescence. Samples were concentrated with solid phase extraction (SPE) and reanalyzed for all measurements and extraction efficiencies were calculated. High resolution mass spectrometry was also performed on SPE samples. Full methodological details are provided in the SPS_EEMs_Methods.csv, SPS_FTICR_Methods.csv and SPS_Roebuck_Methods_Codes.csv in addition to being thoroughly described in the associated manuscript."
    ],
